  "question": "Which zoo is nearest in the east direction from Broadbent Arena, Louisville, KY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-85.745629 38.200638)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.tourism = 'zoo'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 67.5 AND 112.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
